  "narrative": {
    "overview": "Slopsidian Linux is a native Avalonia workspace for operating on notes. Preserve\nthe incumbent typography, icon geometry, pane layout and Fluent controls. The\napproved appearance expansion adds a custom accent, subtle neutral gradients and\na classic black/green Matrix preset to the existing Dark, Light and System modes.\n\nThe direction is neutral and restrained, with static, readable green content for\nMatrix. Theme choice changes color and surface treatment within the same native\ninterface. This document extracts the implementation at commit `bb1ac4e`; native\nsource remains authoritative. `.impeccable/design.json` maps these tokens to\nresource keys, gradient stops and native behavior without an HTML recreation.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Existing flat Dark and Light palettes, with System following the actual OS theme.",
      "Subtle gradients made exclusively from gray, white and black stops.",
      "Near-black Matrix surfaces, green text and a green default accent.",
      "Native controls, visible labels and immediate appearance previews."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Solid Terminal Rule",
